re_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 7.7%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $305M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 18.6%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 4.91"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":59.86,"default_fair_val":59.86,"premium_pct":193.5,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":68.9,"pe_forward":60.6,"pb_trailing":6.5,"pb_forward":5.9,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":16.4,"fcf_to_ev":5.58,"fcf_to_mcap":1.53,"liab_to_assets":18.6,"cash_to_assets":39.3,"current_ratio":4.91,"roe":9.4,"roa":7.7,"moat":{"ticker":"TSEM","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"半導體製造業的產品高度同質化，品牌溢價效應相對有限。TSEM 作為一家專業晶圓代工廠，其客戶主要是需要客製化晶片的設計公司，而非直接面向終端消費者。因此，品牌知名度對其定價權的影響不大，主要競爭力來自於技術能力、產能和成本。雖然其在特定領域（如影像感測器）有一定聲譽，但與消費品牌相比，其品牌護城河較為薄弱。","comment_en":"The semiconductor manufacturing industry features highly commoditized products, limiting the impact of brand pricing power. Tower Semiconductor, as a foundry, primarily serves fabless design companies requiring customized chips, not end consumers. Consequently, brand recognition has minimal influence on its pricing. Its competitive edge lies in technological capabilities, capacity, and cost. While it has a reputation in specific niches like image sensors, its brand moat is relatively weak compared to consumer brands."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"半導體製程技術的複雜性與高昂的研發投入，使得專利成為重要的競爭壁壘。TSEM 在其專注的領域，如影像感測器、類比訊號處理等，擁有一定的專利組合，這能為其客戶提供一定的技術保護，並在一定程度上阻止競爭對手輕易複製其先進製程。然而，半導體技術迭代迅速，專利保護的時效性相對較短，且大型競爭對手（如台積電）在專利數量和廣度上更具優勢。","comment_en":"The complexity and high R&D investment in semiconductor process technology make patents a significant competitive barrier. TSEM holds a portfolio of patents in its focus areas, such as image sensors and analog signal processing, offering some technological protection to its clients and hindering easy replication by competitors. However, the rapid pace of technological advancement in semiconductors means patent protection has a limited lifespan. Furthermore, larger competitors like TSMC possess a greater volume and breadth of patents."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於晶圓代工廠而言，客戶轉換供應商的成本相當高昂。這不僅涉及重新設計和驗證晶片的龐大工程投入，還包括生產線的調試、供應鏈的重塑以及潛在的產能銜接問題。一旦客戶與 TSEM 建立起穩定的合作關係並投入大量資源，轉換到其他代工廠的意願和可行性就會大大降低，這為 TSEM 提供了穩固的客戶黏性。","comment_en":"For foundries, the cost for clients to switch suppliers is substantial. This involves significant engineering investment in redesign and validation, production line adjustments, supply chain restructuring, and potential capacity transition challenges. Once a client establishes a stable relationship with TSEM and invests heavily, their willingness and feasibility to switch to another foundry diminish significantly, providing TSEM with robust customer stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"半導體代工行業的網絡效應非常有限。TSEM 的業務模式是為特定客戶提供服務，其價值主要體現在技術、產能和成本效率上，而非用戶之間的互動或數據共享。與社交媒體或市場平台不同，TSEM 的客戶之間不存在直接的網絡效應，其競爭優勢不依賴於用戶數量的增長帶來的邊際效益遞增。","comment_en":"Network effects are very limited in the semiconductor foundry industry. TSEM's business model focuses on providing services to specific clients, with its value derived primarily from technology, capacity, and cost efficiency, rather than user interaction or data sharing. Unlike social media or marketplace platforms, there are no direct network effects among TSEM's clients. Its competitive advantage does not rely on the marginal benefits of increasing user numbers."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"規模經濟是半導體製造業的核心競爭力之一。TSEM 作為一家具有一定規模的晶圓代工廠，能夠透過大規模生產攤薄固定成本，並在採購原材料時獲得價格優勢。雖然其規模可能不及台積電等行業巨頭，但在其專注的利基市場中，其規模仍能提供顯著的成本效益，使其能夠在價格上與競爭對手抗衡，並維持健康的利潤率。","comment_en":"Economies of scale are a core competitive advantage in semiconductor manufacturing. As a foundry of considerable size, TSEM can spread fixed costs over large production volumes and achieve price advantages in raw material procurement. While its scale may not match industry giants like TSMC, within its niche markets, its size still offers significant cost efficiencies, enabling it to compete on price and maintain healthy profit margins against rivals."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"TSEM 的營運據點主要集中在以色列、美國和歐洲，這些地區擁有成熟的半導體產業生態系統和人才庫。然而，這些地理位置本身並非獨一無二的資產，全球領先的半導體公司（如台積電）在亞洲也擁有龐大的生產基地和完善的供應鏈。因此，其地理位置帶來的護城河效應相對較弱，更多是產業集群效應的體現。","comment_en":"TSEM's operational facilities are primarily located in Israel, the US, and Europe, regions with mature semiconductor industry ecosystems and talent pools. However, these locations are not inherently unique assets. Leading global semiconductor companies, such as TSMC, also operate extensive manufacturing bases and robust supply chains in Asia. Therefore, the moat effect derived from its geography is relatively weak, reflecting more of an industry cluster effect."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"TSEM 在營運效率方面表現出色，尤其是在其專注的利基市場。透過持續的製程優化、嚴格的品質控制和高效的生產管理，公司能夠在複雜的半導體製造過程中實現高良率和準時交付。這種營運上的卓越表現，使其能夠在成本和效率上超越部分競爭對手，為客戶提供可靠的服務，這構成了其重要的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"TSEM demonstrates strong operational efficiency, particularly within its niche markets. Through continuous process optimization, stringent quality control, and effective production management, the company achieves high yields and on-time delivery in the complex semiconductor manufacturing process. This operational excellence allows it to outperform some competitors in terms of cost and efficiency, providing reliable services to its clients, which constitutes a significant competitive barrier."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"TSEM 的財務狀況顯示其擁有健康的現金儲備和較低的負債水平，這為其提供了良好的資本配置彈性。公司能夠透過再投資於研發和擴充產能來維持競爭力，同時也能夠適時進行股票回購或分紅，回報股東。儘管其資本配置決策需要持續關注，但目前穩健的財務結構和過往的投資記錄，顯示其具備較強的資本配置能力。","comment_en":"TSEM's financial health, characterized by healthy cash reserves and low debt, provides considerable flexibility in capital allocation. The company can reinvest in R&D and capacity expansion to maintain competitiveness, while also having the capacity for timely share buybacks or dividends to reward shareholders. While its capital allocation decisions require ongoing scrutiny, its current solid financial structure and past investment record indicate a strong capability in this area."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，高轉換成本是 TSEM 客戶黏性的主要驅動因素。一旦客戶將其關鍵晶片設計託付給 TSEM 生產，並投入了大量的時間和資源進行驗證與優化，他們通常會傾向於長期維持這種合作關係。此外，TSEM 在特定領域（如影像感測器）的技術專長和可靠的產能供應，也進一步增強了客戶的忠誠度，使其客戶留存率保持在較高水平。","comment_en":"As noted in M3, high switching costs are a primary driver of TSEM's customer stickiness. Once clients entrust TSEM with the production of their critical chip designs and invest significant time and resources in validation and optimization, they tend to maintain the partnership long-term. Furthermore, TSEM's technical expertise in specific areas like image sensors and its reliable capacity supply enhance customer loyalty, contributing to a high customer retention rate."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"半導體行業的技術迭代速度快，市場競爭激烈，這對任何公司的長期可持續性都構成挑戰。TSEM 作為一家專業晶圓代工廠，其業務的持久性取決於其持續投入研發、跟上技術趨勢以及有效管理產能的能力。雖然公司在特定領域建立了穩固的地位，但面對來自大型競爭對手和新興技術的潛在顛覆，其護城河的持久性仍需時間驗證。","comment_en":"The rapid pace of technological change and intense market competition in the semiconductor industry pose challenges to the long-term sustainability of any company. As a specialized foundry, TSEM's durability depends on its continuous investment in R&D, its ability to keep pace with technological trends, and effective capacity management. While the company has established a solid position in certain areas, the longevity of its moat remains to be seen against potential disruptions from larger competitors and emerging technologies."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Tower Semiconductor (TSEM) 在半導體代工領域展現了穩固的護城河，尤其體現在高轉換成本（M3）和卓越的營運效率（M7）上。客戶因重新設計和驗證的巨大投入而難以轉換供應商，加上 TSEM 在特定利基市場的技術專長和可靠產能，形成了強勁的客戶黏性。規模經濟（M5）和穩健的資本配置（M8）也提供了成本優勢和財務韌性。然而，其品牌定價權（M1）和網絡效應（M4）較弱，專利（M2）和地理位置（M6）壁壘相對有限，且行業技術快速迭代（M10）帶來持續挑戰。整體而言，TSEM 類似於一個提供關鍵基礎設施的「收費橋」，其護城河主要來自於客戶轉換的高昂成本和營運上的專業性，而非強大的品牌或網絡效應。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Tower Semiconductor (TSEM) exhibits a solid moat in the semiconductor foundry space, primarily driven by high switching costs (M3) and strong operational efficiency (M7). Clients face significant hurdles in redesign and validation, making supplier changes difficult, which, combined with TSEM's technical expertise and reliable capacity in niche markets, creates robust customer stickiness. Economies of scale (M5) and sound capital allocation (M8) also provide cost advantages and financial resilience. However, its brand pricing power (M1) and network effects (M4) are weak, patent (M2) and geographic (M6) barriers are limited, and rapid technological evolution (M10) presents ongoing challenges. Overall, TSEM functions akin to a 'toll bridge' providing essential infrastructure, with its moat stemming mainly from customer inertia and operational excellence rather than strong branding or network effects.","evidenceHash":"fd40474485f5ca2552fdd734f63ca1ee1c31a5df5c301f81c18e6b8735e54fd1","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"760e586af78ef2e8084a0c8072252ad4b52f523fcc50d47b0ae2145a65a3386d"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"760e586af78ef2e8084a0c8072252ad4b52f523fcc50d47b0ae2145a65a3386d"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TSEM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TSEM.png","website":"https://towersemi.com","ceo":"Russell C. Ellwanger","full_time_employees":"5613","description":"Tower Semiconductor Ltd. operates as a prominent independent semiconductor foundry, engaged in the worldwide production and sale of analog-intensive, mixed-signal semiconductor components. The company provides a comprehensive suite of customizable process technologies, including SiGe, BiCMOS, mixed signal/CMOS, RF CMOS, CMOS image sensors, integrated power management solutions, and MEMS. Furthermore, it offers wafer fabrication services, a design enablement platform to streamline the development process, and specialized services for process transfer optimization and new product development. Tower Semiconductor caters to both integrated device manufacturers and fabless companies, with its products serving a wide range of industries such as consumer electronics, computing, telecommunications, automotive, industrial, aerospace, defense, and medical devices. Established in 1993 and based in Migdal Haemek, Israel, its market reach extends across the United States, Japan, other Asian regions, and Europe.","description_en":"Tower Semiconductor Ltd. operates as a prominent independent semiconductor foundry, engaged in the worldwide production and sale of analog-intensive, mixed-signal semiconductor components. The company provides a comprehensive suite of customizable process technologies, including SiGe, BiCMOS, mixed signal/CMOS, RF CMOS, CMOS image sensors, integrated power management solutions, and MEMS. Furthermore, it offers wafer fabrication services, a design enablement platform to streamline the development process, and specialized services for process transfer optimization and new product development. Tower Semiconductor caters to both integrated device manufacturers and fabless companies, with its products serving a wide range of industries such as consumer electronics, computing, telecommunications, automotive, industrial, aerospace, defense, and medical devices. Established in 1993 and based in Migdal Haemek, Israel, its market reach extends across the United States, Japan, other Asian regions, and Europe.","description_zh":"**Tower Semiconductor Ltd. (TSEM) 業務營運精煉報告**\n\nTower Semiconductor Ltd. (TSEM) 為全球領先的獨立半導體晶圓代工廠，專注於生產與銷售類比訊號密集型、混合訊號半導體元件。公司提供多元化的客製化製程技術，涵蓋矽鍺 (SiGe)、雙極互補金屬氧化物半導體 (BiCMOS)、混合訊號/CMOS、射頻 CMOS (RF CMOS)、CMOS 影像感測器、整合式電源管理解決方案，以及微機電系統 (MEMS)。\n\n除晶圓代工服務外，TSEM 並提供設計支援平台以優化開發流程，並針對製程轉移與新產品開發提供專業服務。其客戶群涵蓋整合元件製造商 (IDM) 及無廠半導體公司 (Fabless)，產品廣泛應用於消費性電子、運算、通訊、汽車、工業、航太、國防及醫療設備等多元產業。公司成立於 1993 年，總部位於以色列，業務遍及美國、日本、亞洲其他地區及歐洲。","address":"Ramat Gavriel Industrial Park","city":"Migdal Haemek","state":"HZ","zip":"2310502","country":"IL","phone":"972 4 650 6611","full_address":"Ramat Gavriel Industrial Park, Migdal Haemek, HZ 2310502, IL","range_52w":"72.55-319.94","year_high":319.94,"year_low":72.55,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":72.55,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"Chelouche Yoav","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":232,"price":215.06,"total_val":0.05},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"Ellwanger Russell Craig","title":"officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":1025,"price":245.93,"total_val":0.25},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"Ellwanger Russell Craig","title":"officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2062,"price":246.71,"total_val":0.51},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"Ellwan